{"scenario": "settings/an-agent-cannot-send-overrides", "requires": ["v1", "fake-backend", "test-hooks"], "doc": "config/settings and config/changed are the user's: an agent's connection is not-allowed and the gateway's table does not change."}
{"do": "root"}
